# NOTE: GitHub Pages ignores this file entirely. It is a Cloudflare Pages and
# Netlify convention, kept here so the rules are ready if this site ever moves
# behind one of them. Nothing in it is in effect today — verify with
# `curl -I https://surajkr.dev/` before assuming otherwise.
#
# There is deliberately no X-Robots-Tag here. A noindex on surajkr.dev would
# remove this site from search entirely, and it cannot be used to stop
# imsurajkr.github.io being crawled either — that host is served separately and
# already issues a per-path 301 to surajkr.dev, which is what consolidates it.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload

/netlens.sh
  Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8

/netlens.ps1
  Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
